### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = THAY_BANG_FIREBASE_TOKEN_THAT

### 1. Lấy danh sách sản phẩm
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Chi tiết sản phẩm
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lọc theo giá
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=10000000&maxPrice=30000000&sort=price_asc
Accept: application/json

### 4. Danh mục dạng cây
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 5. Validate coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/coupon/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME10",
  "orderTotal": 2000000
}

### 6. Login bằng Firebase token (cần idToken thật)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "{{adminToken}}"
}

### 7. Xem giỏ hàng (cần token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Thêm vào giỏ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 9. Đặt hàng
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": null,
  "recipientName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "recipientPhone": "0901234567",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Trai, Q1, TP.HCM",
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10",
  "note": "Giao gio hanh chinh"
}

### 10. Lịch sử đơn hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Dashboard admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Low stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/low-stock?threshold=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
